 ***********************************************************
  0. Set up input parameters
 ***********************************************************
 The system is little Endian
  Ensure little Endian -> setenv F_UFMTENDIAN little
    wing side =            2
   ----- Choose 1: left wing, or 2: right wing
    Note: the wing will be facing -ve x-direction,
          so the free steam is assumed to be coming
          from x=-infty and going to x=+infty.


    -------------------------------------------------  
    ----   Maximum level of regular coarsening   ----  
    -------------------------------------------------  
          # of coarse grids that can be generated =            4
    Total grid level (including the target level) =            5
    -------------------------------------------------  
   
    -------------------------------------------------  


