 ***********************************************************
  4.5. Rotate the grid, enforce y=0.0, and scale the grid 
 ***********************************************************
  Performing the switch: y <- x and x <- (-y)..... (Left wing)
  Enforcing y = 0.0 at the symmetry plane.....

  The grid has been rotated for a left wing.
  Enforced y=0.0 at symmetry plane.

  Also performing the 180-degree rotation to generate a right wing.

  Right wing generated.



 ***********************************************************
  5. Write a boundary info file
 ***********************************************************
  Full geometry -> 3 boundary groups.
    --- (1)3D Wing.
    --- (2)Y-Symmetry.
    --- (3)Farfield (inflow and outflow)

  Boundary info file = wing_strct.1.mapbc                                                              

